The Sea at Night

The sea is a symphony of sound,
A lullaby of waves that pound,
A gentle rhythm, a soothing lull,
A dance of darkness, a nighttime hurl.

The moon above, a silver arc,
A beacon in the starry dark,
A silver path that leads the way,
